# Variables and Types Example
# Demonstrates all basic Prose data types.

# Numbers
A Number named Age exists.
Age is 30.
Print "Age is " followed by Age.

# Text
A Text named Name exists.
Name is "Alice".
Print "Name is " followed by Name.

# Entity (object)
A User named Alice exists.
Alice's age is 25.
Alice's role is "Administrator".
Print Alice's role.

# List
A List named Staff exists.
Staff contains Alice.

# Dictionary
A Dictionary named Capitals exists.
Inside Capitals, "France" maps to "Paris".
Inside Capitals, "Japan" maps to "Tokyo".

A Text named Destination exists.
Destination is the value for "Japan" inside Capitals.
Print "The capital of Japan is " followed by Destination.
